    <bpmn:process id="W_W3405" name="W3405. Vendor Cost-Structure &amp; Pass-Through Clause Transparency" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategic-vendor review; contract renewal (links to VS-03.3)
Frequency: Periodic + on renewal
Volume: Top ~50–100 commodity-exposed vendors
Owner: Procurement Director
Participants: Procurement Director, Category Managers, Vendor (links to VS-03.3/VS-03.4), Legal (links to VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W3405 — Vendor Cost-Structure &amp; Pass-Through Clause Transparency</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3405_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3405_Lane1" name="Category Managers">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3405_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3405_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3405_Lane2" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3405_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3405_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3405_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3405_Start4" name="Strategic-vendor review; contract renewal (links to VS-03.3)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3405_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3405_Task5" name="Category Managers/Procurement obtain and document each strategic vendor&#x27;s…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Category Managers/Procurement obtain and document each strategic vendor&#x27;s cost-structure transparency: input-commodity composition (W3402), pricing formula/frequency, index reference, pass-through mechanism (raw-material surcharge, formula price, periodic renegotiation), and lag/lead vs market (W3403)
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Vendor
Accountable (A): Procurement Director
Duration: Per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3405_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3405_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3405_Task6" name="Procurement/Legal review/insert contract clauses governing commodity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement/Legal review/insert contract clauses governing commodity pass-through (raw-material adjustment formula, index, frequency, cap/floor, notice, audit right), indexing mechanics, and duration; ensure clauses are enforceable and benchmarked to market (links to VS-100.3/W230)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): Procurement Director
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3405_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3405_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3405_Task7" name="Procurement maintain the vendor cost-transparency register (vendor, clause…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Procurement maintain the vendor cost-transparency register (vendor, clause type, index, lag, exposure), monitor actual pass-through behavior vs clause (W3417), and feed insights to vendor negotiation (links to VS-03.3) and mitigation strategy (PA-106.2)
Responsible (R): Procurement
Accountable (A): Procurement Director
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3405_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3405_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3405_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
