        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-547 (ensure controlled execution — Commodity Exposure Identification &amp; Market Intelligence (PA-106.1).) | - operational: open-book clauses and index benchmarking (W3403); operational: Legal review (links to VS-100)
Owner: Procurement Director</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
