    <bpmn:process id="W_W3406" name="W3406. Commodity Risk Register, Appetite &amp; Governance Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual risk framework review (links to VS-21.2); board governance cycle (links to VS-36)
Frequency: Annual + quarterly update
Volume: 1 framework; ~10–15 commodity risks
Owner: CFO
Participants: CFO, Procurement Director, Treasury Manager, Risk (links to VS-21.2), Internal Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W3406 — Commodity Risk Register, Appetite &amp; Governance Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3406_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3406_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3406_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3406_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3406_Lane2" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3406_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3406_Lane3" name="Internal Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3406_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3406_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3406_Start5" name="Annual risk framework review (links to VS-21.2); board governance cycle (links to VS-36)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3406_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3406_Task6" name="Treasury/Risk maintain the commodity risk register: each commodity exposure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/Risk maintain the commodity risk register: each commodity exposure (W3401), sensitivity/VaR (W3404), vendor/clause status (W3405), current mitigation (PA-106.2), residual risk, owner, and trend; integrate to the enterprise risk register (links to VS-21.2/W122)
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / Risk
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3406_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3406_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3406_Task7" name="CFO/exec committee set the commodity-risk appetite and policy: acceptable…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CFO/exec committee set the commodity-risk appetite and policy: acceptable margin-at-risk, hedge ratio guidelines, use of financial vs physical hedges, indexed-contract limits, strategic-inventory limits (links to VS-101 OTB), and authority matrix for hedging/pass-through decisions
Responsible (R): CFO / Exec Committee
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3406_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3406_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3406_Task8" name="Internal Audit/CFO review commodity-risk controls and policy adherence (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Internal Audit/CFO review commodity-risk controls and policy adherence (links to VS-21), report to the Audit Committee/Board (links to VS-36), and approve framework updates; ensure disclosure of material commodity risk in financial reporting (links to VS-17)
Responsible (R): Internal Audit / CFO
Accountable (A): Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3406_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3406_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3406_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3406_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-70 (ensure commodity exposure &amp; hedge accounting accuracy.) | - operational: clear policy and authority matrix; operational: quarterly refresh
Owner: CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
